  "gaps": [
    "olpc and clpc do not exist as tokens: the open/closed-loop distinction is tpc and ctl, so a grep for the stage's names returns zero and must not be read as absence of the mechanism",
    "the PAPRD calibration curve and the per-rate correction table are runtime artefacts built by create_curve during a training transmit; no coefficients are in the module",
    "the TPC tables are per-rate and per-country (get_rate_tpc, ctl_by_country) and were not extracted",
    "target power comes from EEPROM (set_target_power_from_eeprom), so it is per-unit calibration data",
    "the thermal link is named (paprd_thermal_send) but the compensation curve was not recovered",
    "GreenTX can skip PAPRD entirely (is_skip_paprd_by_greentx); the condition was not decoded",
    "no dynamic validation"
  ]
